  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Butterless Bearnaise Sauce",
  "description": "A version of the classic bearnaise sauce, made without butter, is thickened with egg yolks and flavored with tarragon Dijon mustard.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
